For L16→L32, start run 1 with:

  bash perfect_blocking_upsampling/scripts/submit_lam1p0_checkerboard_mh.sh r1 --execute --background

  It writes to:

  perfect_blocking_upsampling/outputs/checkerboard_mh_lam1p0/L16toL32/
  L16toL32_N500_S400_start0_div2_D2_sc0p40_sd0p10_r1/

  For L32→L64:

  LC=32 LF=64 N_CHAINS=500 N_SWEEPS=400 START_INDEX=0 \
  bash perfect_blocking_upsampling/scripts/submit_lam1p0_checkerboard_mh.sh r1 --execute --background

  That writes under:

  perfect_blocking_upsampling/outputs/checkerboard_mh_lam1p0/L32toL64/

  The command prints the exact run directory and background PID.
